  "section": "3.276",
  "rulesText": "Cost: 1 Sorcery Point\n\nWhen you cast a spell, such as Charm Person, that can be cast with a higher-level spell slot to target an additional creature, you can spend 1 Sorcery Point to increase the spell's effective level by 1."
}
